WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,770
Forget it, fat man, respect other people's fate.

2
00:00:04,770 --> 00:00:08,770
Newbie, don’t urinate when you see a great man

3
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:10,770
Brother Lin, what should I do next?

4
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:17,540
This is better than school

5
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:20,740
The view is wide and there are not many blind spots where people can hide.

6
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:23,740
It is not easy for a great man to kill someone alone in such an environment

7
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:24,740
As long as we don't scatter

8
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:26,830
They can't find many opportunities to make a move

9
00:00:26,830 --> 00:00:27,830
But the radio said

10
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:29,830
In addition to great men, there are also some strange guys here

11
00:00:29,830 --> 00:00:30,830
Find the exit first

12
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:42,620
Qin Xiucheng, the man by the rock

13
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:45,450
The wound was a private wound

14
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:48,450
The distance between the scars is wider than that of normal people

15
00:00:48,450 --> 00:00:49,450
It's not like a great man did it

16
00:00:49,450 --> 00:00:51,060
It was not done by a great man

17
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:54,060
So is there anything else here?
